    {
      "id": "claim_18511d72776b4ca5819efcfb494632fd",
      "statement": "Local OAuth sign-in and AI Gateway configuration lives in a root .dev.vars file: AUTH_GATEKEEPERS allowlists sign-in gatekeepers whose OAuth credentials are seeded from GITHUB_CLIENT_ID/GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET, GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID/GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET, and CLOUDFLARE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID/CLOUDFLARE_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET; ENABLE_CLOUDFLARE_LIMITS turns on the free-tier + top-up flow; and CF_AI_GATEWAY* enables the platform AI Gateway.",
